abstract: >-
  Replication package for a multi-device empirical comparison of React Native
  Legacy Architecture, React Native New Architecture, and native Android.
  The repository contains benchmark applications, canonical measurement data,
  validation and provenance data, reproducible analysis scripts, and generated
  publication figures.
